<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="mer-v2" name="MER UnB RU v2"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="MER UnB RU — Issue #8 Gestão de Restaurantes e Catracas (v2; base de cenários: 10 features *_v2.feature)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="1350" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Notação: pé-de-galinha, (min,max). Verde = MER principal. Cinza tracejado = Dependência de outra Issue (sem detalhe). PK/FK em negrito." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="45" width="1350" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="restaurantes" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;startSize=30;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="430" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;id&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;nome&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;localizacao&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;capacidade_ref_hora&amp;nbsp;INTEGER NOT NULL  [HIPÓTESE]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;horario_abertura&amp;nbsp;TIME NOT NULL  [PROVISÓRIO]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;horario_fechamento&amp;nbsp;TIME NOT NULL  [PROVISÓRIO]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(7) NOT NULL DEFAULT &amp;#x27;ativo&amp;#x27;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;created_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;updated_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="32" width="430" height="159" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="UNIQUE índice em lower(trim(nome))&lt;br&gt;CHECK length(trim(nome)) &amp;gt; 0 e length(trim(localizacao)) &amp;gt; 0&lt;br&gt;CHECK capacidade_ref_hora BETWEEN 1 AND 5000&lt;br&gt;CHECK horario_abertura &amp;lt; horario_fechamento&lt;br&gt;CHECK status IN (&amp;#x27;ativo&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;inativo&amp;#x27;)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="193" width="430" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="catracas" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;startSize=30;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="80" width="470" height="263" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;id&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;restaurante_id&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;INTEGER NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;codigo&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;piso&amp;nbsp;SMALLINT NULL  [HIPÓTESE; nulo = &amp;quot;Sem piso&amp;quot;]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;corredor_fastpass&amp;nbsp;BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(13) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;created_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;updated_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="c7"><mxGeometry x="0" y="32" width="470" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="FK restaurante_id → restaurantes.id ON DELETE RESTRICT&lt;br&gt;UNIQUE (restaurante_id, lower(trim(codigo)))&lt;br&gt;CHECK codigo: só letras, dígitos e hífen&lt;br&gt;CHECK piso IS NULL OR piso &amp;gt;= 1&lt;br&gt;CHECK status IN (&amp;#x27;ativa&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;inativa&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;em_manutencao&amp;#x27;)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="c7"><mxGeometry x="0" y="176" width="470" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="usuarios" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;startSize=30;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="470" width="330" height="186" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;id&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;nome&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;matricula&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL UNIQUE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;senha_digest&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;perfil&amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(13) NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;created_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;updated_at&amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="c10"><mxGeometry x="0" y="32" width="330" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="CHECK perfil IN (&amp;#x27;administrador&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;funcionario&amp;#x27;)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="c10"><mxGeometry x="0" y="159" width="330" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="turnos  (DEPENDÊNCIA)" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=3;fontSize=12;startSize=30;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;dashed=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="430" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;id&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;restaurante_id&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;…&amp;nbsp;demais atributos: Issue do US14&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="0" y="32" width="430" height="59" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="vinculos_operador_catraca  (DEPENDÊNCIA)" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=3;fontSize=12;startSize=30;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;dashed=1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="470" width="470" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;id&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;usuario_id&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;catraca_id&amp;nbsp;INTEGER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27; color=&#x27;#666666&#x27;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;…&amp;nbsp;demais atributos: Issue do US08&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="c15"><mxGeometry x="0" y="32" width="470" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="possui" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.2143;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2281;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="(0,N)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="476" y="116" width="44" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="(1,1)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="116" width="44" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="possui (dep.)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="vinculada (dep.)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="opera" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;exitX=1;exitY=0.2688;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.4464;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="16"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="(0,N)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="99.5" y="362" width="44" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="(1,1)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="99.5" y="450" width="44" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Notas do DER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Cardinalidade: restaurantes (0,N) — possui — catracas (1,1). Restaurante sem catraca é válido; toda catraca tem exatamente um restaurante (FK NOT NULL, ON DELETE RESTRICT). &quot;Associar Nova Catraca&quot; = criar catraca já vinculada, escolhendo o restaurante no formulário.&lt;br&gt;• Regras fora do SQL puro: RN05 (catraca ativa só em restaurante ativo) = validação de aplicação, sem trigger; inativar restaurante inativa catracas &#x27;ativa&#x27; na mesma transação; RN06 (não remover catraca ativa) = validação/trigger BEFORE DELETE.&lt;br&gt;• usuarios fica sem relacionamento no MER principal: dá suporte a RN01 (perfil) e ao login (US07).&lt;br&gt;• HIPÓTESES: capacidade_ref_hora (&quot;Total&quot; pode ser derivado da soma por catraca) e catracas.piso (agrupamento do Figma, nulo permitido). PROVISÓRIO: horario_* até existir turnos (US14), que passa a ser a fonte de verdade.&lt;br&gt;• Exibição (não são colunas): &#x27;ativa&#x27; = &quot;Online&quot;; &quot;Pronta/Pronto&quot; = NÃO VERIFICADO; &quot;Catraca NN&quot; só para código CAT-NN, senão mostra o código; localizacao guarda só &quot;Central / Gleba A&quot;.&lt;br&gt;• Fora do escopo (HIPÓTESE, Figma não mostra): registros_acesso_catraca, carteiras, transacoes_recarga, cardapios/refeicoes. Dependências cinza: apenas contexto de outras Issues." style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="696" width="1350" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="(0,N)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1224" y="345" width="44" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="(1,1)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1224" y="450" width="44" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="(0,N)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="852" y="500" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="(1,1)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="886" y="500" width="34" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>